  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Women&apos;s Participation in Local election</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the national process of institutionalization and organization of local elections in Angola. The support will focus on the provision of technical assistance to promote impartial participation and representation, inclusive processes and local governance institutions, and strong local democratic culture through citizen ownership. Main outputs include: a) Women are equipped as leaders and effective participants in local elections; b) Participatory budgeting capacity is built</narrative>
  </description>
